 "_doc": "W2-A-LEAVES (2026-11-12): THE LAYER WALKER'S REGISTER, banked at the lane's base deb1544eb (lane/coherence-agree-2026-11-11). SHRINK-ONLY from its first commit: a row may only fall, through its door (node scripts/fact-layers-door.mjs --shrink), in the commit that cures it; no row is ever added and nothing is raised. leaves: each leaf of src/domain/facts/factLayers.js that touches a stratum at or above its own layer, with the strata (the two bundled leaves of the layer map's §2c — the defence object and the crisis home — and what reads through them; the crime structure reading the back-written crime lines; the faith reading touching the cast). pools: each corpus pool whose lines declare or name a fact at or above the pool's layer (factLayers.poolTable.json). readers: per file, per fact family, the lines that answer a homed fact again by a name test outside its home (the defence-reader walker generalised; the defence words stay that walker's).",
